    "long_instructions": "You are building a conversational AI program based on a decision tree.\r\n\r\n**Do This**\r\n\r\n1. Translate your decision tree into a conversational AI Python program.\r\n2. Use conditional statements so that your program can branch in different directions.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nYou can use the provided ask function to prompt the user with a yes/no question and ask them for an answer.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nif ask(\"Do you like sports?\"):\r\n    # Do something\r\nelse:\r\n    # Do something else\r\n\r\n```",
